window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>This book is part of a series, blurb may contain spoilers.</p> <p>A dangerous deal with the devil. To find my way back to those I love, I’m forced to make the ultimate sacrifice. But with that, I lose way more than I realize.</p> <p>In a desperate attempt to focus on the good things left in my life, I devote my time to helping those around me. If I distract myself, maybe I’ll forget all that I lost—or it will hurt a little less.</p> <p>But when I stumble upon a way to potentially regain what is rightfully mine, I grow unsure if I should risk everything one last time. Especially when no one else has ever been able to win this epic battle.</p> <p>Can I overcome the many obstacles that come my way on this journey of redemption? And can I do so while balancing my academic and personal life, too? Or will I succumb to the quest and be doomed to an eternity in Hell?</p> <p>For the Oliver witches, love is above all, and maybe for me, love is the key.</p> <p>Sacred Magic is the fifth installment in a new adult paranormal academy romance series full of determination, unconditional love, and daring risks.</p> <p>NOW A COMPLETED 5-BOOK SERIES! Slow burn, steam increases with series.</p>"; 
